{0}
We provide missions and daily quests that you can complete in the region of {1}.
There are simple daily quests as well as missions that you have to complete within the siege hours only. So, think about it~

scripts.translation:
{0}
我們提供可以在{1}地區完成的委託任務和每日任務。
既有簡單的每日任務，也有僅在攻城戰期間才能完成的委託任務。請好好考慮一下~

