距離下次報告還有一小時的等待時間。請留意這一點，再試一次吧。

scripts.text:
{0}
I'm sorry but conquering missions are for guild masters only.
Members should try guild dungeon daily quests instead.

scripts.translation:
{0}
很抱歉，征服任務僅限公會會長執行。
成員們可以嘗試公會副本的日常任務。

scripts.text:
{0}
These are missions that you can complete in guild dungeons of {1} area.
You can cancel them if you want to. Feel free to challenge yourself.

scripts.translation:
{0}
這些是可以在{1}區域的公會副本中完成的任務。
如果您願意，可以取消它們。請隨意挑戰自己。

scripts.text:
{0}
You don't need to rush since these missions take place in guild dungeons.
Feel free to give it a try whenever you want to.

scripts.translation:
{0}
既然這些任務是在公會副本中進行的，您不必著急。
請隨時嘗試。

scripts.text:
{0}
Hmm, unfortunately, this mission is limited to users with ^4d4dfflevel {1}^000000 or higher only.
Your level is not high enough.

scripts.translation:
{0}
嗯，很遺憾，此任務僅限^4d4dff等級{1}^000000及以上的使用者。
您的等級還不夠高。

scripts.text:
{0}
Oh, you've done a good job.
It isn't much, but hopefully it will be helpful.

scripts.translation:
{0}
哦，您做得很好。
雖然不多，但希望能對您有所幫助。

scripts.text:
{0}
Hmm? It seems like you haven't completed the mission yet..
Is there any problem?

scripts.translation:
{0}
嗯？看來您還沒有完成任務。
有什麼問題嗎？

scripts.text:
{0}
The rule is set here so that you're only allowed to complete one mission each day.
I would like you to come back when the waiting time is over.

scripts.translation:
{0}
這裡的規則規定，您每天只能完成一次任務。
請在等待時間結束後再來。

scripts.text:
{0}
Entrance to the guild dungeon is restricted. But it's not like you can't find a way to go there, either.
I'll pray for your success in fighting those monsters.

scripts.translation:
{0}
公會副本的入口是受限的。但這並不意味著您找不到進入的方法。
我祈禱您在戰鬥中戰勝那些魔物。

scripts.text:
{0}
And of course, I check during the siege hours only.
^4d4dffReceiving a reward is followed by an hour of waiting time. So you'd better figure out the right timing as well.^000000

scripts.translation:
{0}
當然，我只會在攻城戰期間進行檢查。
^4d4dff領取獎勵後需要等待一小時。所以您最好也把握好時機。^000000

scripts.text:
{0}
Guild dungeon daily quests consist of combat quests that you can complete in guild dungeons.
It's simple.

scripts.translation:
{0}
公會副本日常任務由可以在公會副本中完成的戰鬥任務組成。
很簡單。
